    },
    {
      "displayText": "你知道阿柏蛇吗？\n它是一种会扭来扭去的蛇宝可梦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6077E59053963F67CF86C75417FF1F000A5B83662F4E0079CD4F1A626D6765626D53BB768486C75B9D53EF68A6FF01001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可是阿柏蛇的身体究竟到\n哪部分为止是尾巴呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF662F963F67CF86C776848EAB4F537A767ADF5230000A54EA90E852064E3A6B62662F5C3E5DF45462FF1F001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也许摸一摸它就能知道了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F8BB864784E0064785B835C3180FD77E590534E86FF01001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我妈妈说过\n野生特区的宝可梦很危险……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71366211598859888BF48FC7000A91CE751F7279533A76845B9D53EF68A65F885371966920262026001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但如果是训练家的宝可梦，\n那应该就没问题了吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F465982679C662F8BAD7EC35BB676845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A90A35E948BE55C316CA195EE98984E865427FF1F001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是你捉到了阿柏蛇，\n就让我也摸一摸吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F4F60634952304E86963F67CF86C7FF0C000A5C318BA962114E5F64784E0064785427FF01001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让我摸一摸阿柏蛇的尾巴！\n捉到它后放进同行宝可梦里带来给我吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
