      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "明明尾巴以外都是冷冷冰冰滑滑的，\n却只有尾巴是软软弹弹肉肉的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "660E660E5C3E5DF44EE5591690FD662F51B751B751B051B06ED16ED17684FF0C000A537453EA67095C3E5DF4662F8F6F8F6F5F395F398089808976843002001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说不定阿柏蛇也知道\n自己的尾巴摸上去有多舒服。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF44E0D5B9A963F67CF86C74E5F77E59053000A81EA5DF176845C3E5DF464784E0A53BB6709591A8212670D3002001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蛇～♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "86C7FF5E266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要能摸阿柏蛇的尾巴，\n就随时都能快乐起来！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA898180FD6478963F67CF86C776845C3E5DF4FF0C000A5C31968F65F690FD80FD5FEB4E508D776765FF01001000020114012A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也要捉只阿柏蛇来，\n享受无限的尾巴快乐！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
